          if (a.noticing === 'decisions') s += ' You notice it most around choices and transitions, when attention is already organized around the pending call.';
          if (a.trigger === 'decision-moment') s += ' It appeared mid-decision, and the timing felt charged \u2014 that charge came from you, not from the number.';
          s += ' Here\u2019s the honest read: when you saw it, you felt either a yes or a flicker of resistance. That response is your own orientation, made legible for a second. The number didn\u2019t answer the question \u2014 it showed you your lean.';
