          if (a.unresolved === 'raw') s += ' You know what it is, and you don\u2019t go there \u2014 which is precisely why the dream does.';
          if (a.trigger === 'recurring' || a.status === 'recurring-person') s += ' The recurrence is doing what recurrence does: flagging, again, what hasn\u2019t been acknowledged.';
          s += ' The way out isn\u2019t a better interpretation and isn\u2019t necessarily confrontation. It\u2019s acknowledgment \u2014 naming the thing honestly, on paper or out loud, and letting it be true. Recurring dreams tend to change character once the material is met directly.';
