        dontTell: 'An unreadable dream isn\u2019t a meaningless one \u2014 it means the material hasn\u2019t come into focus yet. At this stage, symbol dictionaries are the main hazard: every generic entry gets recruited as evidence for whichever reading you\u2019re already leaning toward.',
