        dontTell: 'This result can\u2019t tell you that you will find someone \u2014 nobody honest can, and anyone who promises it is selling comfort. What it also can\u2019t do is confirm the fear. The belief \u201Cit isn\u2019t available to me\u201D feels like data; it\u2019s a hypothesis \u2014 and hypotheses can be checked against what\u2019s actually happening now.',
