            'Notice what the date was supposed to settle. The waiting? The asking? The fear? The specific answer points at the real question \u2014 which, unlike the date, is actually workable.',
            'If you take a reading anyway, take it on the present: the chapter, the blocks, the readiness. A reader who works in ranges and tendencies and refuses the date is the reader worth having.'
