        dontTell: 'An unsettled answer isn\u2019t a meaningless one. At this stage, the main hazard is the marketplace: readers who type everyone from a birthday table will happily type you too \u2014 the placement reading is a bestseller precisely because it arrives regardless of input. A verdict that arrives no matter what you answer is proof it came from the seller, not from your chart.',
