        dontTell: 'This result can\u2019t confirm that the nodal axis shaped your development \u2014 that claim sits outside what any study tests, and this page won\u2019t certify it. What it also can\u2019t do is dismiss the practice: as a structured reflective vocabulary for direction, it demonstrably helps people examine growth they care about. What you can honestly examine is whether the map keeps generating examinable questions \u2014 that, not belief, is the mark of a framework earning its keep.',
