        dontTell: 'This result can\u2019t complete your portrait for you \u2014 three placements are three angles, not a whole chart, and no quiz can fill the rest in by description. What it also can\u2019t do is sentence you to the single layer: the mismatch you may be feeling is a known limitation of the tool, not a verdict on you. What you can honestly examine is whether the missing angles are reachable \u2014 a year for the Moon, a time and a place for the Rising \u2014 and whether one solid input beats three approximate ones, because an estimated Rising is a range, not a point.',
