        dontTell: 'This result can\u2019t confirm that placements shape personality \u2014 that claim sits outside what any study tests, and this page won\u2019t certify it. What it also can\u2019t do is dismiss the practice: as a structured way to separate how you feel, how you act, and how you\u2019re seen, the trio demonstrably helps people examine things they care about. What you can honestly examine is whether the three mirrors keep generating checkable questions \u2014 that, not belief, is the mark of a framework earning its keep.',
