    title: 'How Are You Actually Meeting the Process?',
    launchSub: 'Eight questions, about two minutes. It works outward from where you stand \u2014 what brought the question up, how long this has been running, which of the signs are present, and what kind of help would fit \u2014 and ends on the step that fits.',
    subtitle: 'Eight questions, about two minutes. A personalized read of how you\u2019re actually meeting the process \u2014 what it suggests, what it doesn\u2019t, and what to watch next. No score, no verdict, no signup.',

