          if (a.shadow === 'open') s += ' You gave the shadow comfortable room \u2014 which is the mark of the serious version of this work. The murky state is where the information lives; the bright version of a color is the aftermath of tending, not a style to wear.';
          if (a.want === 'shift') s += ' And you asked how to brighten what\u2019s murky \u2014 the honest answer starts with what the murk is made of: usually strain, unrest, or something unprocessed. Brightening practices that skip the source \u2014 smudges over an unexamined week \u2014 redecorate the readout without moving the life that produces it.';
          s += ' The examinable move: name the one thing in your actual life the murk is most plausibly responding to \u2014 and give that the next month, before any tool, spray, or session.';
