          if (a.use === 'proof') s += ' You said the color confirms there\u2019s more going on than science sees. Hold the layers separately: the body\u2019s glow is real and measured \u2014 faint, metabolic, rhythmic; the perception reports are widespread; what is not established is that any color reading carries information. A description that fits everyone proves something about language, not about fields \u2014 and using it as proof is the leap the evidence doesn\u2019t carry.';
          if (a.use === 'horoscope' && a.verify === 'unchecked') s += ' And the readings have never been checked against anything \u2014 which is the missing piece that keeps the resonance feeling like truth. Resonance is what broad descriptions produce in nearly everyone; it is not evidence. The check is simple and free: next reading, write down in advance what it would need to say to be wrong.';
