        dontTell: 'This result can\u2019t settle whether the field is real \u2014 the emission is measurable and the perception reports are widespread, and this quiz doesn\u2019t adjudicate that question. What it can\u2019t do either is let the broad description ride as proof: a fit-everything reading is data about language, and the marketplace sells it as data about your soul. What you can honestly examine is the pattern of what lands: track the next few readings against specifics, and watch how much of the accuracy survives being written down in advance.',
