        dontTell: 'An unsettled answer isn\u2019t a meaningless one. At this stage, the main hazard is the marketplace: a verdict that arrives no matter what you answer is proof it came from the seller, not from your situation \u2014 and this market sells \u201Crare hybrid colors\u201D and \u201Cblocked fields\u201D with equal enthusiasm to whoever walks in. The honest version holds the question open until the material itself settles it.',
