          text: 'when the karmic frame becomes the load-bearing reason to stay, it does its real work quietly: it converts a relationship that keeps wounding you into tuition, and every exit into quitting the lesson \u2014 so the pain reads as progress and the lock reads as a curriculum. The honest test: state the case for staying with no karma, no signs, no destiny in it. What remains is the actual relationship. If nothing remains, the frame wasn\u2019t describing the love \u2014 it was substituting for it.'
