        dontTell: 'This result can\u2019t grade your progress \u2014 no quiz, teacher, or framework can, and the ladder-selling that promises to is the single most reliable red flag in this market. What it also can\u2019t do is dismiss the experiences themselves: strange and profound things may genuinely be happening. What you can honestly examine is the direction \u2014 whether life is getting more workable under the process or less \u2014 because that trend, not the strangeness, is what every honest map of this territory actually tracks.',
        watchIntro: 'The honest next step, in order:',
