        dontTell: 'This result can\u2019t diagnose anything \u2014 a pattern check is not a clinician; what it can say is that the markers you describe are the ones that belong in professional hands first. What it also can\u2019t do is strip the meaning out of what you\u2019re moving through: getting care is not the failure of the spiritual frame \u2014 it is what the frame\u2019s own serious authors instructed. What you can honestly examine, once care is in place, is what all of this is asking of you \u2014 with support, at a pace that doesn\u2019t require being your own clinician.',
