        dontTell: 'This result can\u2019t tell you whether spirits or energies were involved \u2014 no quiz can; what it can say is that the ordinary layer explains most of what rooms feel like, and that every honest cleansing tradition starts there. What it also can\u2019t do is dismiss the ritual: ceremony genuinely helps humans mark transitions, and marking a reset is not nothing. What you can honestly examine is the before-and-after \u2014 the space rated honestly before the work and after it \u2014 which is the only review that separates a reset from a purchase.',
