          if (a.want === 'address') s += ' You asked the address question directly \u2014 the space or me. The honest test that separates them: the space changes when other people are in it. If the room feels fine to a visitor and wrong to you on the same afternoon, the house was never the subject. If everyone who enters feels it, the space earns its own investigation.';
