            'List the exemption\u2019s rulings: the last five things you didn\u2019t do, ask, or try because the theme ruled. Next to each, write what the decision would have been if the wound got a vote instead of a veto \u2014 one vote, like everything else.',
            'Then execute the smallest one this month, wound along for the ride. Each completed ruling the exemption loses, the more it returns to its honest size \u2014 context for decisions, not their replacement.'
